+
+#### Canton for the pension fund
+The pension fund's 'Canton' field means the canton of residence. For employees living in Switzerland it is the canton they answered; employees living abroad have no canton of residence, so the canton of the place of work is used instead, which for Muster AG is Zurich. Employees living abroad are not asked anything for it.
